OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FRemaining breezy with showers in the
OL,7,Fnorth on Saturday. Largely dry with
OL,8,Fwarm sunshine further south. Most
OL,9,Fplaces dry on Sunday, then showers
OL,10,Fcould break out more widely on Monday.
